  "body": "`picture` and `del` should be listed in the [**palpable content**](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#palpable-content) category.\r\n\r\nFWIW this change request does not impact implementations nor tests; the **palpable content** category is purely informative and is not even checked by validator.nu as far as I know.\r\n\r\n## `del` element\r\n\r\nThe `p` element in this example:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<p><del>removed</del></p>\r\n```\r\n\r\nis currently not satisfying the soft requirement that it should have at last one node in its contents that is palpable content.  \r\nAdding `del` to the list of **palpable content** would fix that.\r\n\r\n## `picture` element\r\n\r\nThe `p` element in this example:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<p>\r\n  <picture>\r\n    <source srcset=\"image.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">\r\n    <img src=\"image.jpg\" alt=\"\"/>\r\n  </picture>\r\n</p>\r\n```\r\n\r\nis currently not satisfying the soft requirement that it should have at last one node in its contents that is palpable content.  \r\nAdding `picture` to the list of **palpable content** would fix that.",
